sequenceDiagram
    participant Job as Scheduled Job
    participant SVN as SVN Repository
    participant Parser as Log Parser
    participant API as Planning API
    participant DB as Storage
    participant Matcher as Matcher

    Job->>SVN: svn log --xml
    SVN-->>Job: revision history
    Job->>Parser: parse XML log
    Parser-->>Job: structured commit list

    Job->>API: fetch planned items in date window
    API->>DB: query PlannedCommit / PlannedEvent
    DB-->>API: planned items
    API-->>Job: planned items

    Job->>Matcher: match(actualCommits, plannedItems)
    Matcher-->>Job: ReconciliationResult[]

    Job->>API: persist reconciliation results
    API->>DB: save ReconciliationResult
    DB-->>API: ack
    API-->>Job: done
